2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2398) 'Check: `tests/gate_fabric_two_clients.gd` runs server, worker and two players over loopback and reads each client's view of the other's pose; the Lean tests search for a frame with two owners or none across boundary crossings at candidate speeds and link delays. Control: the staging timeout floor removed with a one-tick delay rolls A back to OWNED while B's ACK is in flight, and the search finds two owners.
 # tags: rfd:details
